	(text "PHASE 4 - ASSEMBLY OPTION: FITTED ON PV-P100/110 ONLY"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 408.504 116.352 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "027e3a82-d047-518b-8394-2254e9fba0d8")
	)
	(text "TH_OV: VA/VB 1084 V; TH_OTH: heatsink 87.9 C (PV-PWR: <= 89.9 C); TH_OTL: inductor 150 C;\nTH_OPEN 2.975 V: an NTC node above it is an open probe (cold limit -30 C)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 257.608 86.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "05e43c9f-0d00-5c12-8404-934a87239177")
	)
	(text "PHASES 1-3 AND THE PORT VOLTAGES (FITTED ON EVERY BUILD)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 116.352 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7cefcdb8-7afb-59b2-a893-74c1cf47a3ee")
	)
	(text "ILnR - 715R - TH_ILn_HI - 19.1k - TH_ILn_LO - 20.0k - GND: the window follows the sensor's own zero (Vref\n2.48-2.52 V is no longer an error term; Voe +/-10 mV is). 1 M from VREF to TH_ILn_LO: with the sensor dead\n(IL = ILR = 0 V) TH_ILn_LO stays ~30 mV above ILn_P and the phase trips. Phase 4: fitted on every build."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 103.852 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ba684384-d27c-5b81-b7fc-0dde696dcdef")
	)
	(text "IL THRESHOLD LADDERS (0.1 %, 25 PPM/K), ONE PER PHASE FROM THAT SENSOR'S UREF (ILNR ON PC)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ca98392d-10e7-51b0-88cd-18bccc6b940f")
	)
	(text "IL4 window, NTC4 / NTC8 over-temperature and open probe. Not fitted on PV-P75 (bom/PV-CTL-P75_BOM.csv),\nwhere IL4 = 0 V and NTC4 / NTC8 are open: nothing then pulls OC_N / OVT_N for phase 4. Fitted on a\n4-phase build, a dead IL4 sensor (0 V) or an open NTC4 / NTC8 trips (fail-safe). Firmware cross-checks."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 408.504 164.252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d004cac8-3c89-53c7-b06b-98f089e14377")
	)
	(text "OC_N (wired-OR, 10k to +3V3): ILn_P above TH_ILn_HI or below TH_ILn_LO, n = 1-3. OVT_N (10k): VA, VB above\nTH_OV; NTC1-3 (heatsink) below TH_OTH, NTC5-7 (inductor) below TH_OTL; any of them above TH_OPEN.\nPort over-current (387-413 A) arrives on FLT_N from the power board's own comparators (PV-PWR)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 192.952 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f39722e1-16c7-5248-bf65-50e87bc55051")
	)
